WEBVTT

00:00:19.716 --> 00:00:21.717
- (LIVELY MUSIC PLAYING)
- (PEOPLE CHEERING)

00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:23.636
(BARKER SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

00:00:28.391 --> 00:00:29.809
(ROARING)

00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:33.062
(CHEERING CONTINUES)

00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:36.232
- (INDISTINCT CHATTERING)
- (CREATURE GROWLING)

00:00:44.157 --> 00:00:45.574
(PEOPLE GASP)

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:01.841
Nagini.

00:01:06.179 --> 00:01:07.179
(GASPS)

00:01:07.597 --> 00:01:08.848
Credence.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.270
I think I know where she is.

00:01:20.443 --> 00:01:21.694
We escape tonight.

00:01:21.862 --> 00:01:22.862
Hey.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.120
I've told you
to stay away from her, boy.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.581
Did I say you could take a break?

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:35.875
Clean out the Kappa.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.670
And you, get ready.

00:01:45.177 --> 00:01:46.677
(CREATURES HISSING)

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:56.478
Next, in our little show
of freaks and oddities,

00:01:56.938 --> 00:02:01.317
I present to you a Maledictus.

00:02:01.484 --> 00:02:03.235
(AUDIENCE GASPING)

00:02:04.905 --> 00:02:07.615
Once trapped
in the jungles of Indonesia,

00:02:08.533 --> 00:02:11.410
she is the carrier of a blood curse.

00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:12.703
AUDIENCE: Ohh!

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:17.416
SKENDER: Such Underbeings are destined
through the course of their lives

00:02:17.959 --> 00:02:20.336
to turn permanently into beasts.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.254
AUDIENCE: Ohh!

00:02:23.924 --> 00:02:24.924
SKENDER: But look at her.

00:02:25.634 --> 00:02:28.010
So beautiful. Yes.

00:02:29.846 --> 00:02:31.805
So desirable.

00:02:32.557 --> 00:02:36.685
But soon, she will be trapped forever
in a very different body.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.191
Every night when she sleeps,
<i>mesdames et messieurs,</i>

00:02:43.735 --> 00:02:46.153
she is forced to become...

00:02:48.114 --> 00:02:49.615
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:54.246 --> 00:02:55.913
- She is forced to become...
- (AUDIENCE CHATTERING)

00:03:01.336 --> 00:03:04.046
She is forced to become...

00:03:05.173 --> 00:03:06.590
(CHATTER STOPS)

00:03:10.428 --> 00:03:12.012
(AUDIENCE GASPING)

00:03:13.306 --> 00:03:16.934
Over time, she will not be able
to transform back.

00:03:17.769 --> 00:03:19.395
(HISSING)

00:03:19.479 --> 00:03:23.357
She will be forever trapped
in the body of a snake.

00:03:28.071 --> 00:03:29.071
(CREDENCE GRUNTS)

00:03:29.155 --> 00:03:30.155
(CREATURES SCREECHING)

00:03:30.782 --> 00:03:31.782
- (GROANS)
- (AUDIENCE GASPS)

00:03:32.742 --> 00:03:33.909
(SCREECHING CONTINUES)

00:03:35.453 --> 00:03:37.204
(PANICKED SCREAMING)

00:03:51.011 --> 00:03:53.220
- (CREATURE ROARING)
- (SCREAMING CONTINUES)

00:03:53.596 --> 00:03:54.805
(MAN SCREAMING)

00:03:56.975 --> 00:03:57.975
Credence!

00:04:01.062 --> 00:04:02.229
(ROARS)

00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:07.276
(GROANS)

00:04:07.694 --> 00:04:08.902
Pack it up.

00:04:08.987 --> 00:04:10.738
Paris is done for us now.

00:04:38.725 --> 00:04:40.601
(BLOWING)

00:04:40.685 --> 00:04:43.062
The boy with the Maledictus,
what do you know about him?

00:04:46.983 --> 00:04:48.650
He's looking for his mother.

00:04:48.818 --> 00:04:51.111
All my freaks think they can go home.

00:04:54.407 --> 00:04:55.657
Okay, let's go.

00:05:12.592 --> 00:05:14.468
Look, I think you and I
were at the circus

00:05:14.552 --> 00:05:16.053
for the same reason, Monsieur...

00:05:16.721 --> 00:05:18.555
Kama. Yusuf Kama.

00:05:19.849 --> 00:05:21.100
And you think right.

00:05:21.184 --> 00:05:23.227
- What do you want with Credence?
- The same as you.

00:05:23.395 --> 00:05:24.395
Which is?

00:05:24.479 --> 00:05:26.271
To prove who the boy really is.

00:05:30.193 --> 00:05:32.236
If the rumors of his identity
are correct,

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.906
he and I are, distantly, related.

00:05:37.575 --> 00:05:39.660
I am the last male
of my pure-blooded line,

00:05:39.744 --> 00:05:41.954
and so,
if the rumors are correct, is he.

00:05:44.082 --> 00:05:47.876
Have you read
<i>The Predictions of Tycho Dodonus?</i>

00:05:48.545 --> 00:05:51.880
Yeah. But that's poetry, not proof.

00:05:51.965 --> 00:05:53.048
YUSUF: Hmm.

00:05:55.301 --> 00:05:57.219
If I could show you something better,

00:05:58.847 --> 00:06:02.099
more concrete,
something that proves who he is,

00:06:02.976 --> 00:06:05.811
would the Ministries of Europe
and America let him live?

00:06:07.564 --> 00:06:08.981
They might.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.109
Then come.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.077
(BLOWING)

